OL,3,GNEWSANew hub aims to get young people
OL,4,Aworking
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn initiative to help young people into
OL,7,Fwork or education has been launched in
OL,8,FLuton.
OL,10,FLuton Youth Hub on Gordon Street has
OL,11,Freceived #4.5m in joint funding from
OL,12,FLuton Council and the Department for
OL,13,FWork and Pensions.
OL,15,FThe project will run workshops on CV
OL,16,Fwriting, interview preparation and
OL,17,Fdigital skills, and aims to support up
OL,18,Fto 300 people aged 16 to 24 in its
OL,19,Ffirst year.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
