OL,3,GNEWSANew hub aims to get young people
OL,4,Aworking
OL,5,
OL,6,FSophie Inman, an employment specialist
OL,7,Fteam leader at the council, said: "The
OL,8,Fyouth hub is providing the opportunity
OL,9,Ffor young people to feel heard,
OL,10,Flistened to, a safe space that they can
OL,11,Fthen open up about what their
OL,12,Findividual challenges are."
